    "detailed_description": "20 popular Forty Thieves games in one.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDo you love Forty Thieves Solitaire (also known as &quot;Napoleon at St Helena&quot; or &quot;Big Forty&quot;), but want a bigger challenge?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNow you can play Forty Thieves Solitaire and other popular variants with different levels of difficulty.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe collection contains:<br />\r\n\u2022 Ali Baba<br />\r\n\u2022 Breakwater<br />\r\n\u2022 Busy Aces<br />\r\n\u2022 Deuces<br />\r\n\u2022 Forty Thieves<br />\r\n\u2022 Miss Milligan<br />\r\n\u2022 Parliament<br />\r\n\u2022 Red and Black<br />\r\n\u2022 Single Rail<br />\r\n\u2022 Thieves of Egypt<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlus 10 more...<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n\u2022 Unlimited undo<br />\r\n\u2022 Auto complete<br />\r\n\u2022 Statistics<br />\r\n\u2022 Rules for each game",
